<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Legalease | AI-Powered Legal Document Generator</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            background: #f5f7fb;
            color: #172033;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* ================= NAVBAR ================= */

        .navbar {
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.95);
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 1000;
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 16px 25px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
            font-size: 25px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #172554;
        }

        .logo-icon {
            width: 42px;
            height: 42px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #172554;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 21px;
        }

        .nav-links {
            display: flex;
            gap: 28px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-links a {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #475569;
            font-weight: 600;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .nav-links a:hover {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        .nav-actions {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .btn {
            border: none;
            padding: 11px 20px;
            border-radius: 9px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 700;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .btn-primary {
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
        }

        .btn-primary:hover {
            background: #1d4ed8;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-outline {
            background: white;
            color: #2563eb;
            border: 1px solid #2563eb;
        }

        .btn-outline:hover {
            background: #eff6ff;
        }

        .menu-btn {
            display: none;
            border: none;
            background: none;
            font-size: 25px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        /* ================= HERO ================= */

        .hero {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 90px 25px 80px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
            gap: 60px;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .badge {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 7px 13px;
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: #1d4ed8;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-size: 13px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: clamp(42px, 5vw, 67px);
            line-height: 1.05;
            color: #0f172a;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .hero h1 span {
            color: #2563eb;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #64748b;
            max-width: 650px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .hero-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 14px;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }

        .hero-card {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 25px;
            padding: 25px;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 70px rgba(15,23,42,0.12);
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        }

        .ai-header {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            margin-bottom: 22px;
        }

        .ai-avatar {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        .ai-header h3 {
            font-size: 17px;
        }

        .ai-header small {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        .chat {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 13px;
        }

        .message {
            padding: 13px 15px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .user-message {
            background: #eff6ff;
            align-self: flex-end;
            max-width: 85%;
        }

        .bot-message {
            background: #f8fafc;
            align-self: flex-start;
            max-width: 90%;
        }

        /* ================= STATS ================= */

        .stats {
            background: #172554;
            color: white;
        }

        .stats-container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 35px 25px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
            text-align: center;
        }

        .stat h2 {
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        .stat p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ================= SECTION ================= */

        .section {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            padding: 90px 25px;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 50px;
        }

        .section-title h2 {
            font-size: 40px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #0f172a;
        }

        .section-title p {
            color: #64748b;
        }

        /* ================= FEATURES ================= */

        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3,1fr);
            gap: 22px;
        }

        .feature-card {
            background: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 17px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            transition: 0.3s;
        }

        .feature-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-7px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(15,23,42,0.08);
        }

        .feature-icon {
            width: 52px;
            height: 52px;
            background: #eff6ff;
            color: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 13px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 23px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .feature-card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .feature-card p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* ================= GENERATOR ================= */

        .generator-wrapper {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 22px;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 50px rgba(15,23,42,0.07);
        }

        .generator-header {
            background: #172554;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px 30px;
        }

        .generator-header h2 {
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }

        .generator-header p {
            color: #cbd5e1;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        .generator-body {
            padding: 30px;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
            gap: 35px;
        }

        .form-group {
            margin-bottom: 18px;
        }

        .form-group label {
            display: block;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 7px;
        }

        select,
        input,
        textarea {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 12px 14px;
            border: 1px solid #dbe1ea;
            border-radius: 9px;
            outline: none;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: 0.2s;
        }

        select:focus,
        input:focus,
        textarea:focus {
            border-color: #2563eb;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px #dbeafe;
        }

        textarea {
            min-height: 130px;
            resize: vertical;
        }

        .preview {
            background: #f8fafc;
            border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 30px;
            min-height: 420px;
        }

        .preview-top {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 25px;
        }

        .preview h3 {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .document-content {
            white-space: pre-wrap;
            font-family: Georgia, serif;
            color: #334155;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        /* ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= */

        .steps {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4,1fr);
            gap: 20px;
        }

        .step {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .step-number {
            width: 55px;
            height: 55px;
            background: #2563eb;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 18px;
            font-size: 19px;
            font-weight: 800;
        }

        .step p {
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ================= AI SECTION ================= */

        .ai-section {
            background: #eff6ff;
        }

        .ai-box {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: auto;
            background: white;
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 45px rgba(37,99,235,0.1);
        }

        .question-box {
            display: flex;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .question-box input {
            flex: 1;
        }

        #aiAnswer {
            display: none;
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 18px;
            background: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
        }

        /* ================= FOOTER ================= */

        footer {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            padding: 60px 25px 25px;
        }

        .footer-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: auto;
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 50px;
        }

        footer h3 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        footer p,
        footer a {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        footer a {
            display: block;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 8px 0;
        }

        footer a:hover {
            color: white;
        }

        .copyright {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 40px auto 0;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #334155;
            text-align: center;
            color: #64748b;
            font-size: 13px;
        }

        /* ================= DARK MODE ================= */

        body.dark {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }

        body.dark .navbar,
        body.dark .feature-card,
        body.dark .generator-wrapper,
        body.dark .ai-box,
        body.dark .hero-card {
            background: #1e293b;
            border-color: #334155;
        }

        body.dark .hero h1,
        body.dark .section-title h2,
        body.dark h3 {
            color: #f8fafc;
        }

        body.dark .hero p,
        body.dark .feature-card p,
        body.dark .section-title p {
            color: #94a3b8;
        }

        body.dark .preview {
            background: #0f172a;
            border-color: #334155;
        }

        body.dark input,
        body.dark textarea,
        body.dark select {
            background: #0f172a;
            color: white;
            border-color: #475569;
        }

        /* ================= RESPONSIVE ================= */

        @media (max-width: 900px) {

            .hero {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                padding-top: 60px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
            }

            .generator-body {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .steps {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr);
            }

            .footer-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            }

            .nav-links {
                display: none;
                position: absolute;
                top: 73px;
                left: 0;
                width: 100%;
                background: white;
                flex-direction: column;
                padding: 20px 25px;
                border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
            }

            .nav-links.active {
                display: flex;
            }

            .menu-btn {
                display: block;
            }

            .nav-actions .btn {
                display: none;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .hero h1 {
                font-size: 43px;
            }

            .stats-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                gap: 20px;
            }

            .features {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .steps {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .footer-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .generator-body {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            .question-box {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<!-- ================= NAVBAR ================= -->

<nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">

        <div class="logo">
            <div class="logo-icon">⚖</div>
            Legalease
        </div>

        <ul class="nav-links" id="navLinks">
            <li><a href="#home">Home</a></li>
            <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
            <li><a href="#generator">Generator</a></li>
            <li><a href="#assistant">AI Assistant</a></li>
            <li><a href="#about">About</a></li>
        </ul>

        <div class="nav-actions">
            <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="toggleDarkMode()">◐</button>
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scrollToGenerator()">Get Started</button>
        </div>

        <button class="menu-btn" onclick="toggleMenu()">☰</button>

    </div>
</nav>


<!-- ================= HERO ================= -->

<section class="hero" id="home">

    <div>

        <span class="badge">✦ AI-POWERED LEGAL TECHNOLOGY</span>

        <h1>
            Legal documents,
            <span>made simple.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
            Create professional legal document drafts in minutes
            using AI-powered assistance. Describe your requirements
            in simple language and let Legalease help structure your document.
        </p>

        <div class="hero-buttons">
            <button class="btn btn-primary" onclick="scrollToGenerator()">
                Create Document →
            </button>

            <button class="btn btn-outline" onclick="scrollToAssistant()">
                Ask AI Assistant
            </button>
        </div>

    </div>


    <div class="hero-card">

        <div class="ai-header">

            <div class="ai-avatar">✦</div>

            <div>
                <h3>Legalease AI</h3>
                <small>Legal document assistant</small>
            </div>

        </div>

        <div class="chat">

            <div class="message user-message">
                I need a complaint letter for an online purchase issue.
            </div>

            <div class="message bot-message">
                Certainly. I can help structure a general complaint-letter
                draft. Please provide the relevant details.
            </div>

            <div class="message user-message">
                The product was not delivered after payment.
            </div>

            <div class="message bot-message">
                ✓ Issue identified: Consumer complaint<br><br>
                ✓ Document type: Complaint Letter<br><br>
                ✓ Ready to generate your draft.
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= STATS ================= -->

<section class="stats">

    <div class="stats-container">

        <div class="stat">
            <h2>AI</h2>
            <p>Assisted Generation</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
            <h2>24/7</h2>
            <p>Accessible Platform</p>
        </div>

        <div class="stat">
            <h2>Simple</h2>
            <p>User-Friendly Interface</p>
        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= FEATURES ================= -->

<section class="section" id="features">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>Everything you need</h2>

        <p>
            Tools designed to make legal document preparation easier.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="features">

        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">✦</div>

            <h3>AI-Powered Generation</h3>

            <p>
                Describe your requirements in natural language and
                generate a structured document draft.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">📄</div>

            <h3>Document Templates</h3>

            <p>
                Choose from different document categories and
                customize them according to your requirements.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">🔍</div>

            <h3>Legal Information</h3>

            <p>
                Access organized general legal information and
                relevant official resources.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">⚡</div>

            <h3>Fast Processing</h3>

            <p>
                Quickly create a structured draft without manually
                formatting the entire document.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">🔐</div>

            <h3>Secure Design</h3>

            <p>
                Designed with authentication, validation and
                responsible handling of user information.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="feature-card">

            <div class="feature-icon">🌐</div>

            <h3>Accessible Anywhere</h3>

            <p>
                Responsive interface designed for desktop,
                tablet and mobile devices.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= GENERATOR ================= -->

<section class="section" id="generator">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>AI Document Generator</h2>

        <p>
            Enter your information and create a basic document draft.
        </p>

    </div>


    <div class="generator-wrapper">

        <div class="generator-header">

            <h2>Create Your Document</h2>

            <p>
                Fill in the details below to generate a document preview.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="generator-body">

            <!-- FORM -->

            <div>

                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>Document Type</label>

                    <select id="documentType">

                        <option value="complaint">
                            Consumer Complaint Letter
                        </option>

                        <option value="notice">
                            General Legal Notice
                        </option>

                        <option value="rti">
                            RTI Application
                        </option>

                        <option value="rental">
                            Rental Agreement Draft
                        </option>

                        <option value="application">
                            Legal Application Letter
                        </option>

                    </select>

                </div>


                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>Your Name</label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="userName"
                        placeholder="Enter your full name"
                    >

                </div>


                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>Recipient / Organization</label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="recipient"
                        placeholder="Enter recipient name"
                    >

                </div>


                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>Subject / Issue</label>

                    <input
                        type="text"
                        id="subject"
                        placeholder="Enter document subject"
                    >

                </div>


                <div class="form-group">

                    <label>Describe Your Situation</label>

                    <textarea
                        id="description"
                        placeholder="Explain your situation in simple language..."
                    ></textarea>

                </div>


                <button
                    class="btn btn-primary"
                    style="width:100%;"
                    onclick="generateDocument()"
                >
                    ✦ Generate Document
                </button>

            </div>


            <!-- PREVIEW -->

            <div class="preview">

                <div class="preview-top">

                    <strong>Document Preview</strong>

                    <button
                        class="btn btn-outline"
                        onclick="downloadDocument()"
                    >
                        Download
                    </button>

                </div>


                <h3 id="previewTitle">
                    Consumer Complaint Letter
                </h3>


                <div
                    class="document-content"
                    id="documentContent"
                >
                    Your generated document will appear here.

                    Fill in the required details and click
                    "Generate Document".
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= HOW IT WORKS ================= -->

<section class="section">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>How Legalease Works</h2>

        <p>Create a document through four simple steps.</p>

    </div>


    <div class="steps">

        <div class="step">

            <div class="step-number">1</div>

            <h3>Describe</h3>

            <p>
                Explain your legal document requirement
                in simple language.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="step">

            <div class="step-number">2</div>

            <h3>Analyze</h3>

            <p>
                The system identifies the document category
                and required information.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="step">

            <div class="step-number">3</div>

            <h3>Generate</h3>

            <p>
                Legalease creates a structured document draft
                using the provided information.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="step">

            <div class="step-number">4</div>

            <h3>Review</h3>

            <p>
                Review the draft and obtain professional advice
                when necessary before using it.
            </p>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= AI ASSISTANT ================= -->

<section class="ai-section" id="assistant">

    <div class="section">

        <div class="section-title">

            <h2>Ask Legalease AI</h2>

            <p>
                Ask a general legal-information question.
            </p>

        </div>


        <div class="ai-box">

            <div class="ai-header">

                <div class="ai-avatar">✦</div>

                <div>
                    <h3>AI Legal Assistant</h3>
                    <small>
                        General legal information assistant
                    </small>
                </div>

            </div>


            <div class="question-box">

                <input
                    type="text"
                    id="aiQuestion"
                    placeholder="Example: What should I include in a complaint letter?"
                >

                <button
                    class="btn btn-primary"
                    onclick="askAI()"
                >
                    Ask
                </button>

            </div>


            <div id="aiAnswer"></div>

        </div>

    </div>

</section>


<!-- ================= ABOUT ================= -->

<section class="section" id="about">

    <div class="section-title">

        <h2>About Legalease</h2>

        <p>
            An academic project demonstrating how AI and web
            technologies can assist with legal document preparation.
        </p>

    </div>

    <div class="feature-card">

        <h3>Our Mission</h3>

        <br>

        <p>
            Legalease aims to make basic legal document preparation
            easier by combining artificial intelligence,
            natural-language processing and web technology.
        </p>

        <br>

        <p>
            The platform provides general information and document
